  "limitations": [
    "NNTR_MOE_IO_PROFILE differs (v15=1, v12=0), source/artifacts and execution dates differ; similar starting temperatures do not establish identical frequency/storage state.",
    "OP-TIME is the sum of node bodies, not the complete app prefill timer; graph bookkeeping, sampling, staging scope setup and cleanup are outside node bodies.",
    "HTP process summaries include constructor warmups and model load. QS2 IO read/copy counters span load plus prefill, not prefill alone.",
    "Reader per-record clocks run concurrently; the aggregate is not elapsed latency. Reader allocation, queue waits and stage promotions are not included in addPrefetchRead.",
    "Logcat timestamps have millisecond resolution and there are no per-record start/end events or staging scope start/end events. First queue-release times and cleanup attribution are therefore inferred.",
    "Deferred RMSNorm cost is included in its consuming Conv/QKV/router operation; tiny norm-node times do not mean norm arithmetic was removed."
